598
00:32:35,280 --> 00:32:36,760
Janice?

599
00:32:38,040 --> 00:32:39,520
Janice?

600
00:33:03,680 --> 00:33:05,520
JANICE GROANS

601
00:33:21,520 --> 00:33:23,360
DOOR LOCK RATTLES

602
00:33:45,440 --> 00:33:47,280
DOOR HANDLE RATTLES

603
00:34:03,360 --> 00:34:05,040
DOORBELL

